1
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:42,650
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:47,640
[Episode 8: Nannan's Little Tricks]

3
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:49,800
Ms. Xie,

4
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,080
I personally

5
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:55,000
really appreciate your talent and drive.

6
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,460
Regarding contracting the factory,

7
00:00:57,480 --> 00:01:00,120
you can come to my office anytime.

8
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:02,720
Or,

9
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:04,640
we can find a

10
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:06,400
quiet place

11
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,600
to have a really good chat.

12
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:15,400
Okay.

13
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:16,600
No problem.

14
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:24,280
Ms. Xie,

15
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:26,080
I think

16
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:28,600
this is a very important matter.

17
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:34,360
We really need to

18
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:36,479
chat properly.

19
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,120
Communicate more,

20
00:01:38,360 --> 00:01:39,289
don't you think?

21
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:41,200
Look at you, so young

22
00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:42,400
and so capable.

23
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:46,000
That's really rare.

24
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:49,800
Director Liu.

25
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:51,800
Mr. Chu?

26
00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:54,120
You...

27
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,800
Stop there, you wretched woman!

28
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:16,720
My time is very precious.

29
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,360
You're using our time

30
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:19,620
to do things like this.

31
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,760
Isn't it inappropriate?

32
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:23,600
Mr. Chu.

33
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:26,720
This is the new rising star in Shencheng,

34
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:29,480
the CEO of the Lumina brand.

35
00:02:54,650 --> 00:02:55,810
You two must be

36
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:57,800
meeting for the first time.

37
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:58,400
Get out.

38
00:02:59,550 --> 00:03:00,550
I said get out.

39
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,800
Don't you have anything to say to me?

40
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:20,970
Long time no see,

41
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:22,520
Mr. Chu.

42
00:03:27,480 --> 00:03:29,540
Do you think these fake pleasantries

43
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:33,410
can explain everything
that happened back then?

44
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:39,000
The past is already done.

45
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:40,770
I came back this time

46
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,480
to move forward.

47
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:46,079
Mom!

48
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,680
Mom.

49
00:03:48,740 --> 00:03:49,579
Nannan.

50
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,600
Handsome daddy.

51
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:04,280
Nannan, let's go.

52
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:05,140
Nanfeng!

53
00:04:08,900 --> 00:04:09,740
Xie Nanfeng!

54
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:14,620
Where have you been these five years?

55
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,399
Is this child mine or not?

56
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:19,399
No.

57
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:21,010
He's not.

58
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,760
That's my private business.

59
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,320
I have no need to tell you.

60
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:28,820
Then why did you come back?

61
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,780
I didn't come back for you.

62
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,730
I just want to get the factory back.

63
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:39,140
My number hasn't changed.

64
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:40,880
If you need anything,

65
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,000
contact me.

66
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:52,400
Nannan.

67
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:56,200
Why do you think he is your dad?

68
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:58,600
Because I've seen him before.

69
00:04:58,880 --> 00:05:00,600
In your wallet.

70
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:03,780
In the hidden slot of your wallet,
placed face down.

71
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:13,600
Nannan.

72
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:17,520
Didn't Mom tell you?

73
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:20,420
You don't necessarily need a dad.

74
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:24,000
Mom can raise you all by herself,

75
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,680
and raise you very well.

76
00:05:27,330 --> 00:05:28,330
Do you believe me?

77
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,820
Are you waiting for me?

78
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,400
I've been waiting for you forever.

79
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:57,080
Here, for you.

80
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:57,800
For me?

81
00:05:58,159 --> 00:05:59,090
Thank you, baby.

82
00:06:01,840 --> 00:06:03,300
I knew you'd be here again.

83
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,800
Um,

84
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:08,000
we found Ms. Xie's whereabouts.

85
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:12,040
She went to the committee
to discuss business with Director Liu.

86
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:17,400
Compile all documents

87
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:18,930
on Nanfeng's time in the US.

88
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,850
I want them all before tonight.

89
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:21,810
Yes, sir.

90
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:30,400
Nanfeng,

91
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:32,960
what exactly is your relationship

92
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:34,120
with that Mr. Chu?

93
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:40,320
You little troublemaker.

94
00:06:40,320 --> 00:06:41,280
Look at you.

95
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:43,640
You're making things
very difficult for me.

96
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:45,040
Since you're here today,

97
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:47,600
let's have a good chat.

98
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,640
Director Liu.

99
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:53,200
I'm here to talk business.

100
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:56,640
Is there any progress
on the contract approval?

101
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:00,080
About your case,

102
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:02,740
it involves foreign capital.

103
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,760
The process is naturally

104
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:07,520
a bit more complicated.

105
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:09,800
That's why

106
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:12,240
the two of us need

107
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:13,800
to communicate more.

108
00:07:14,320 --> 00:07:16,650
I don't want you wasting your time either.

109
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:20,000
What if I don't want to communicate?

110
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:25,200
Then we'll follow the standard procedure.

111
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:26,520
Wait,

112
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:28,720
get approval,

113
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:29,800
get the stamp,

114
00:07:30,090 --> 00:07:31,090
do it step by step.

115
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:34,000
As for when it gets done,

116
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,490
it's hard to say.

117
00:07:37,280 --> 00:07:38,400
Then can this

118
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,600
speed up the approval?

119
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:44,000
If you want to do it this way,

120
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:45,600
it's not impossible.

121
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,600
Xie Nanfeng,

122
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:58,880
you've got some nerve.

123
00:07:58,880 --> 00:08:00,080
You dare threaten me?

124
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:03,120
Then I have to thank you for cooperating.

125
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:07,120
You think a few lousy photos

126
00:08:07,200 --> 00:08:08,400
can threaten me?

127
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:09,600
In your dreams!

128
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:10,920
Is that so?

129
00:08:17,400 --> 00:08:18,320
Honey?

130
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:20,080
She... I...

131
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:21,560
Why are you here?

132
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:22,800
Did you think I needed to rely on

133
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:24,400
a few photos to get this done?

134
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:26,920
Chief Yang has already helped me

135
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,120
sort out the process.

136
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:30,400
Liu Tiezhu!

137
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,840
You've really gotten
too big for your boots, haven't you?

138
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:32,600
No, no, no.

139
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:35,320
My dad swallowed his pride
to get you a position,

140
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:37,200
and you're here lording it over people.

141
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:37,520
No, no.

142
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:39,940
I usually turn a blind eye.

143
00:08:39,970 --> 00:08:41,360
Did you really think
I was that easy to fool?

144
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:42,760
Honey, I was just confused for a moment.

145
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:44,400
Let me explain!

146
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,200
Chief Yang,

147
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:45,800
I'll let you get back to affairs.

148
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:47,000
I won't disturb you anymore.

149
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,360
Xie Nanfeng,

150
00:08:48,380 --> 00:08:48,880
you...

151
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:51,200
Look at these photos!

152
00:08:51,650 --> 00:08:52,080
Listen to me...

153
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,940
How are you going to explain this?

154
00:08:57,760 --> 00:08:58,400
How is it?

155
00:08:59,240 --> 00:08:59,920
I found it.

156
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:04,800
I checked US marriage records

157
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:08,280
and Shencheng Civil Affairs Bureau
archives.

158
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:10,480
Miss Xie has no record
of ever being married.

159
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,240
On Nannan's birth certificate,

160
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:14,500
the father's information is also blank.

161
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:17,400
November 4, 1992.

162
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:22,330
Nanfeng and I separated
at the end of 1991.

163
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,800
Based on this timeline,

164
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:27,720
Nannan was conceived
only after she went to the US.

165
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:29,120
Could Nannan

166
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:31,200
really not be mine?

167
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:38,520
Hello?

168
00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:39,600
Daddy.

169
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:44,400
Nannan?

170
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:45,800
Yes.

171
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,560
Your mom hasn't agreed

172
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,890
to let me be your dad yet.

173
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:55,720
Nannan.

174
00:09:56,130 --> 00:09:57,810
Why are you calling me?

175
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,840
Did something happen to Mom?

176
00:10:00,010 --> 00:10:01,410
Mom is taking a shower.

177
00:10:01,680 --> 00:10:03,600
I'm calling you secretly.

178
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:08,040
Dad, do you love Mom?

179
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,280
Why are you asking this all of a sudden?

180
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:14,410
You were really angry when you saw Mom.

181
00:10:14,730 --> 00:10:17,730
But you got worried when you saw her sad.

182
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:20,840
Isn't that what Mom calls love?

183
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,120
It is.

184
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,920
But your mom doesn't love me.

185
00:10:29,880 --> 00:10:31,800
But I called you

186
00:10:32,280 --> 00:10:34,520
because this is the only photo
and phone number

187
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:37,480
kept in Mom's wallet.

188
00:10:40,430 --> 00:10:41,150
Dad.

189
00:10:41,460 --> 00:10:43,700
Hurry and win Mom back.

190
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:50,520
Okay.

191
00:10:52,310 --> 00:10:53,110
I promise you.
